WEBVTT

00:08:30.673 --> 00:08:34.969
In America, osmosis will have you knowing
men’s sports storylines.

00:08:35.010 --> 00:08:36.762
(Laughter)

00:08:37.304 --> 00:08:39.056
And by the way,

00:08:39.056 --> 00:08:42.685
when men have a daughter
and they finally get women's sports,

00:08:42.726 --> 00:08:44.812
what they're really saying is,

00:08:44.812 --> 00:08:48.482
they finally have a front-row seat
to the stakes and the storylines.

00:08:52.278 --> 00:08:54.113
Let's go back in time again.

00:08:54.905 --> 00:08:57.157
Philadelphia, 1931.

00:08:57.491 --> 00:09:00.953
The Philadelphia Quicksteppers,
an all-Black women's basketball team,